---
/* Final registration success step */
---
<section class="registration-step success-step" data-step="success" hidden>
  <div class="success-mark">&#10003;</div>
  <h2>ثبت نام شما با موفقیت انجام شد</h2>
  <p>کارشناسان آموزشگاه برای هماهنگی نهایی با شما تماس خواهند گرفت.</p>
  <div class="tracking-card"><span>کد پیگیری</span><strong data-field-out="success-tracking-code">-</strong></div>
  <div class="review-card"><h3>خلاصه ثبت نام</h3><div class="review-row"><span class="review-label">ساز</span><span class="review-value" data-field-out="success-instrument">-</span></div><div class="review-row"><span class="review-label">استاد</span><span class="review-value" data-field-out="success-instructor">-</span></div><div class="review-row"><span class="review-label">روز و زمان کلاس</span><span class="review-value" data-field-out="success-schedule">-</span></div></div>
  <div class="materials-card" data-materials-container></div>
  <div class="contract-card">
    <div class="contract-card-heading"><span class="contract-card-kicker">DOCUMENT · FATEH MUSIC</span><h3>قرارداد هنرجویی</h3><span class="contract-card-line"></span></div>
    <p class="contract-note">قرارداد بر اساس اطلاعات ثبت‌نام شما تکمیل شده است. نسخه چاپی برای امضای هنرجو و آموزشگاه آماده است.</p>
    <div class="contract-body" data-contract-container hidden></div>
    <button type="button" class="secondary-btn contract-print-btn" data-action="print-contract">چاپ قرارداد</button>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-card"><h3>نیاز به مشاوره خرید ساز دارید؟</h3><p>کارشناسان آموزشگاه فاتح شما را در انتخاب ساز مناسب راهنمایی می‌کنند.</p><div class="contact-links" data-contact-links></div></div>
  <div class="success-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary-btn" data-action="print-receipt">چاپ رسید ثبت نام</button><button type="button" class="btn" data-action="back-home">بازگشت به صفحه اصلی</button></div>
</section>
<style is="global">
.contract-card{position:relative;margin-top:32px;padding:30px;border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.28);border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(212,175,55,.055),rgba(255,255,255,.025) 42%,rgba(255,255,255,.015));overflow:hidden}.contract-card::before,.contract-card::after{content:"";position:absolute;pointer-events:none;border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.12);border-radius:14px}.contract-card::before{inset:9px}.contract-card::after{inset:14px;border-style:dashed;opacity:.65}.contract-card>*{position:relative;z-index:1}.contract-card-heading{text-align:center;margin-bottom:22px}.contract-card-kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:7px;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;direction:ltr}.contract-card-heading h3{margin:0;font-size:27px}.contract-card-line{display:block;width:90px;height:2px;margin:11px auto 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold),transparent)}.contract-note{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 25px;padding:12px 16px;border-inline-start:2px solid var(--gold-dark);background:rgba(212,175,55,.045);color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;text-align:center}.contract-body{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px 34px;background:#fffdf8;color:#000;border:1px solid #d9cda9;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.14),inset 0 0 0 6px rgba(212,175,55,.035);direction:rtl}.contract-body::before{content:"آموزشگاه موسیقی فاتح  •  قرارداد هنرجویی";display:block;padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:20px;border-bottom:2px solid #b9973e;color:#000;text-align:center;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}.contract-article{position:relative;padding:15px 18px;margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid #e7dfc9;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffefa,#fcf8ed);color:#000}.contract-article:first-child{padding:5px 0 12px;border:0;background:transparent;text-align:center}.contract-article:first-child p{margin:0;color:#000;font-weight:800;font-size:16px}.contract-article h4{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0 0 9px;color:#000;font-size:14px}.contract-article h4::before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:5px;height:20px;border-radius:3px;background:#b9973e}.contract-article p{margin:0;color:#000;font-size:12.5px;line-height:2.15;text-align:justify}.contract-article:nth-child(4){border-color:#cbb36f;background:#fffaf0}.contract-signature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #cbbf9f}.contract-signature-col{min-height:92px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #ded3b7;border-radius:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:7px;text-align:center;color:#000;font-size:11px}.contract-signature-col:first-child{border-top:3px solid #b9973e}.contract-signature-col:last-child{border-top:3px solid #000}.contract-print-btn{display:block;margin:24px auto 0;min-width:180px}.print-contract-header,.print-contract-footer{display:none}
@media(max-width:700px){.contract-card{padding:22px 12px}.contract-body{padding:22px 14px}.contract-signature{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contract-card-heading h3{font-size:25px}}
@media print{
 @page{size:A4 portrait;margin:0}
 html,body{width:210mm!important;height:297mm!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;background:#fff!important;overflow:hidden!important;print-color-adjust:exact;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact}
 body.printing-contract *{visibility:hidden!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-card,body.printing-contract .contract-card *{visibility:visible!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-card{display:block!important;position:relative!important;width:210mm!important;height:297mm!important;max-width:none!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;background:#fff!important;overflow:hidden!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-card>.contract-card-heading,body.printing-contract .contract-card>.contract-note,body.printing-contract .contract-card>.contract-print-btn{display:none!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-body{position:relative!important;width:210mm!important;height:297mm!important;max-width:none!important;max-height:none!important;margin:0!important;padding:32mm 16mm 24mm!important;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;background:#fff!important;overflow:hidden!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;page-break-after:avoid!important;break-after:avoid-page!important;color:#000!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-body::before,body.printing-contract .contract-body::after{content:none!important;display:none!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-contract-header{display:grid!important;position:absolute!important;top:6mm!important;right:14mm!important;left:14mm!important;width:auto!important;height:22mm!important;grid-template-columns:34mm 1fr 52mm!important;align-items:center!important;direction:ltr!important;border-bottom:.45mm solid #b9973e!important;color:#000!important;z-index:20!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-contract-logo{display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:flex-start!important;height:19mm!important}.print-contract-logo img{display:block!important;width:19mm!important;height:19mm!important;object-fit:contain!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-contract-title{display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;height:19mm!important;color:#000!important;font-family:Vazirmatn,sans-serif!important;font-size:18pt!important;font-weight:900!important;white-space:nowrap!important;letter-spacing:0!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-contract-date{display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:flex-end!important;height:19mm!important;color:#000!important;font-family:Vazirmatn,sans-serif!important;font-size:9pt!important;font-weight:700!important;white-space:nowrap!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-contract-footer{display:grid!important;position:absolute!important;right:14mm!important;left:14mm!important;bottom:5mm!important;height:16mm!important;grid-template-columns:1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1.25fr!important;align-items:center!important;direction:rtl!important;gap:3mm!important;border-top:.35mm solid #b9973e!important;color:#000!important;font-family:Vazirmatn,sans-serif!important;font-size:6.6pt!important;line-height:1.5!important;white-space:nowrap!important;z-index:20!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-footer-item{display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;min-width:0!important;height:10mm!important;padding:0 2mm!important;color:#000!important;border-left:.2mm solid #d8c899!important}
 body.printing-contract .print-footer-item:last-child{border-left:0!important}.print-footer-label{font-weight:800!important;margin-left:2mm!important;color:#000!important}.print-footer-value{font-weight:500!important;color:#000!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-article{margin-bottom:5px!important;padding:9px 12px!important;border-radius:6px!important;break-inside:avoid!important;page-break-inside:avoid!important;box-shadow:none!important;color:#000!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-article:first-child{padding:0 0 7px!important;margin-bottom:5px!important}.contract-article:first-child p{font-size:12pt!important;line-height:1.35!important;color:#000!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-article h4{margin:0 0 3px!important;font-size:9pt!important;line-height:1.25!important;color:#000!important}.contract-article h4::before{width:3px!important;height:13px!important;background:#b9973e!important}.contract-article p{font-size:8.2pt!important;line-height:1.42!important;margin:0!important;color:#000!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-signature{margin-top:7px!important;padding-top:7px!important;gap:14px!important;break-inside:avoid!important;page-break-inside:avoid!important;color:#000!important}body.printing-contract .contract-signature-col{min-height:55px!important;padding:7px!important;gap:3px!important;border-radius:5px!important;font-size:8pt!important;color:#000!important}
 body.printing-contract .contract-body,body.printing-contract .contract-body *,body.printing-contract .contract-body p,body.printing-contract .contract-body span,body.printing-contract .contract-body strong,body.printing-contract .contract-body h1,body.printing-contract .contract-body h2,body.printing-contract .contract-body h3,body.printing-contract .contract-body h4,body.printing-contract .contract-body div{color:#000!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#000!important;text-shadow:none!important}
}
</style>
